      "descriptionHtml": "<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> Lightweight woven dress fabric with a soft peach skirt, black bodice, and silver sequin-style waist panel; exact fiber composition was not visible in the supplied evidence.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> A polished mother-daughter dress look for birthdays, vacations, dinners, and photo days when a little sparkle feels just right.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Print reference:</strong> Peach Sparkle pairs a warm peach skirt with a black top and bright silver waist detail.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Sleeveless black bodice, gathered peach skirt, and a wide sequin-style waist panel shown on both mom and daughter.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Hand wash or machine wash cold on gentle, turn inside out, line dry, and avoid bleach or high heat to protect the sparkle detail.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Child 1-2 Years through Child 9-10 Years, plus Mother S through Mother 2XL.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Size Chart - Dress</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Size</th>\n<th>Age</th>\n<th>Weight (kg/lbs)</th>\n<th>Height (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Chest/Bust (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Skirt Length (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Pant/Short or - (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Hip (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Waist (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Garment Length (cm/in)</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 1-2 Years</td>\n<td>1-2</td>\n<td>8.5-11 kg / 18.7-24.3 lbs</td>\n<td>75-85 cm / 29.5-33.5 in</td>\n<td>63 cm / 24.8 in</td>\n<td>58 cm / 22.8 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>67 cm / 26.4 in</td>\n<td>63 cm / 24.8 in</td>\n<td>58 cm / 22.8 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 2 Years</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>11-14 kg / 24.3-30.9 lbs</td>\n<td>85-95 cm / 33.5-37.4 in</td>\n<td>66 cm / 26.0 in</td>\n<td>63 cm / 24.8 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>70 cm / 27.6 in</td>\n<td>66 cm / 26.0 in</td>\n<td>63 cm / 24.8 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 3 Years</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>14-16.5 kg / 30.9-36.4 lbs</td>\n<td>95-105 cm / 37.4-41.3 in</td>\n<td>69 cm / 27.2 in</td>\n<td>68 cm / 26.8 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>73 cm / 28.7 in</td>\n<td>69 cm / 27.2 in</td>\n<td>68 cm / 26.8 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4 Years</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>16.5-20 kg / 36.4-44.1 lbs</td>\n<td>105-115 cm / 41.3-45.3 in</td>\n<td>72 cm / 28.3 in</td>\n<td>73 cm / 28.7 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>76 cm / 29.9 in</td>\n<td>72 cm / 28.3 in</td>\n<td>73 cm / 28.7 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5 Years</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>18.5-24 kg / 40.8-52.9 lbs</td>\n<td>115-125 cm / 45.3-49.2 in</td>\n<td>75 cm / 29.5 in</td>\n<td>78 cm / 30.7 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>79 cm / 31.1 in</td>\n<td>75 cm / 29.5 in</td>\n<td>78 cm / 30.7 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-7 Years</td>\n<td>6-7</td>\n<td>24-27.5 kg / 52.9-60.6 lbs</td>\n<td>125-130 cm / 49.2-51.2 in</td>\n<td>78 cm / 30.7 in</td>\n<td>83 cm / 32.7 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>82 cm / 32.3 in</td>\n<td>78 cm / 30.7 in</td>\n<td>83 cm / 32.7 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8 Years</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>27.5-32.5 kg / 60.6-71.7 lbs</td>\n<td>130-140 cm / 51.2-55.1 in</td>\n<td>81 cm / 31.9 in</td>\n<td>88 cm / 34.6 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>85 cm / 33.5 in</td>\n<td>81 cm / 31.9 in</td>\n<td>88 cm / 34.6 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 Years</td>\n<td>9-10</td>\n<td>32.5-37.5 kg / 71.7-82.7 lbs</td>\n<td>140-150 cm / 55.1-59.1 in</td>\n<td>84 cm / 33.1 in</td>\n<td>93 cm / 36.6 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>88 cm / 34.6 in</td>\n<td>84 cm / 33.1 in</td>\n<td>93 cm / 36.6 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother S</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>42.5-50 kg / 93.7-110.2 lbs</td>\n<td>155-160 cm / 61.0-63.0 in</td>\n<td>86 cm / 33.9 in</td>\n<td>100 cm / 39.4 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>92 cm / 36.2 in</td>\n<td>84 cm / 33.1 in</td>\n<td>100 cm / 39.4 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother M</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>50-57.5 kg / 110.2-126.8 lbs</td>\n<td>160-165 cm / 63.0-65.0 in</td>\n<td>90 cm / 35.4 in</td>\n<td>102 cm / 40.2 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>96 cm / 37.8 in</td>\n<td>88 cm / 34.6 in</td>\n<td>102 cm / 40.2 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother L</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>59-69 kg / 130.1-152.1 lbs</td>\n<td>160-170 cm / 63.0-66.9 in</td>\n<td>94 cm / 37.0 in</td>\n<td>104 cm / 40.9 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>100 cm / 39.4 in</td>\n<td>92 cm / 36.2 in</td>\n<td>104 cm / 40.9 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother XL</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>70-80 kg / 154.3-176.4 lbs</td>\n<td>160-175 cm / 63.0-68.9 in</td>\n<td>98 cm / 38.6 in</td>\n<td>106 cm / 41.7 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>104 cm / 40.9 in</td>\n<td>96 cm / 37.8 in</td>\n<td>106 cm / 41.7 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother 2XL</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>80-92.5 kg / 176.4-203.9 lbs</td>\n<td>160-175 cm / 63.0-68.9 in</td>\n<td>102 cm / 40.2 in</td>\n<td>108 cm / 42.5 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>108 cm / 42.5 in</td>\n<td>100 cm / 39.4 in</td>\n<td>108 cm / 42.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Peach Sparkle gives a mommy-and-me dress moment a clean, dressy finish without feeling too formal. The black bodice keeps the look polished, while the peach skirt and silver waist detail add the soft shine that makes family photos feel a little more special.</p>\n\n<p>The attached fit chart publishes height and weight guidance for child dress rows and mother dress rows. Infant crawler rows and father rows were not included because the supplied product image supports the mother-daughter dress design only.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Mother-daughter dress sizing:</strong> Girl and Mother dress rows only, mapped directly from the attached chart.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Sequin-style waist detail:</strong> A bright silver waist panel creates the standout matching moment.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Polished color mix:</strong> Black, peach, and silver give the dress a party-ready look that still works for warm-weather photos.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Chart-backed variants:</strong> Every Shopify variant corresponds to a vendor size row from the attached evidence.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Draft-only review:</strong> Created unpublished so fabric details and final merchandising can be checked before launch.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose the sizes you need and build a sweet, sparkle-waist mommy-and-me dress look for your next photo-ready family plan.</p>",
